        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As infrastructure sectors move toward more data-centric workflows, we are developing a new generation of digital-twin native, AI-powered, and Bentley Infrastructure Cloud-connected applications to further improve individual and team productivity and collaboration.",
